{"channelId":"UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw","row":["International Animal Rescue IAR",185000,"At International Animal Rescue we not only save animals from suffering, we also rehabilitate and release them back into the wild and work to protect their precious natural habitats. Our work includes cutting free and caring for captive bears in India and Armenia, rescuing and rehabilitating orangutans and other primates in Indonesia and treating injured and orphaned howler monkeys in Costa Rica. Our aim is to return animals to their natural environment wherever possible, but we also provide a permanent home for those that can no longer fend for themselves.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:12.636Z","channelId":"UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"343706231335fa67f7fbdb4d567bdc78aadf617b2b7d5f75e782e600727a60c4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"d501379e8acedeb621508c93d69a6f96a24b695aa401cfc0ac044561de19c6b9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:18:28.384Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":185000,"raw":"185K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:12.636Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvTjxxIIDaE0ydeMqbSStgw"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文